    {
      "question": "What are employees in Pakhlai?",
      "mode": "legacy",
      "http_status": 200,
      "duration_ms": 19630.469,
      "provider_attempts": 6,
      "answer": {
        "id": 78,
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "In Pakhlai, \"employees\" are **staff records** managed from the Admin/BranchAdmin area at **HR → Staff** (`/admin/dashboard/staff`). A staff record is more than a name on a list: it combines the person's identity details, their login account and role (which decides which portal and access they get), their branch-level assignments, and their payroll profile.\n\nWhat a staff record holds (from the Add Staff modal):\n\n- **Identity:** Full Name, Email and Phone (all required), optional Hire Date, optional Profile Image.\n- **Role:** required; picked from the implemented Staff roles and determines portal/access. Administrator role options are hidden unless the current user's role is Admin. Custom Role is an optional free-text display label.\n- **Work assignment:** Shift (optional; must belong to the current branch — another branch's shift is rejected) and Kitchen Stations (only shown for the kitchen-manager role; submitted as station IDs). No station assignment means the broad kitchen queue rather than zero visibility.\n- **Delivery:** Vehicle Number (for the driver role, used to identify the vehicle in assignments).\n- **Payroll profile:** Salary Type (default monthly; monthly/weekly/daily/hourly, used by payroll generation), Base Salary (blank becomes 0), Payment Day (default 1; does not schedule an automatic transfer), Allowances, Deductions, Overtime Rate (blank become 0), Payroll Notes, Payroll Active checkbox (default on) and Status (default Active; affects active payroll eligibility).\n- **Login:** Username (optional — may be generated when absent; check uniqueness) and optional initial Password for a login-capable role.\n\nRelated records that reference staff: **Shifts** and **Attendance** (HR → Shifts / Attendance, also available to OperationsManager), which record a daily Present / Absent / Leave status for assigned staff — there is no leave-approval or automatic payroll-hours workflow — and **salary profiles / payroll**, where employee records feed payroll generation and salary payment.\n\nAuthority notes: only Admin/BranchAdmin can create staff; BranchAdmin is limited to exactly one branch and cannot create or promote administrator accounts, move staff to another branch, or change their own role. OperationsManager can list staff via the API for attendance purposes, and FinanceManager can read/update records through payroll salary profiles, but neither gets an unrestricted Staff route.\n\nScope note: this describes documented behavior only — I have no access to your live staff list or any live data.",
        "kind": "answer",
        "state": "complete",
        "error_code": null,
